       [{:symbol seon.program/reach-digests,
         :summary
           "{test var -> reach digest} of db's tests (task seon.program/tests-run-by-reach): the digest of the test's name, inputs' :env (what has no program facts), its own form, its namespace's forms that define no var (the ns form, fixtures), and every live form their references reach (a var to the form that last defined it, macros and quoted names among them (unit-account); a defined multimethod's methods and protocol's extensions; a contracted var's form to the schema entries its contract names, and each entry to those its form names; a var named in data its form reads, inputs' :data-refs: system.edn's procs, which root resolves by name), with inputs' :tree when a reached form references a tree-reader.",
         :arglists ([db inputs] [db inputs roots])}]}
